Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 18:53:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] Scheduler per request: GenerationConfiguration.scheduler
 (appended int field), applied to a copy of the generator

Values 0 default, 1 simple, 2 sgm_uniform, 3 normal, 4 karras, 5 exponential,
6 linear_quadratic, 7 beta. A request's scheduler wins over the generator's own;
0 or an unknown value keeps it. Readers without the field see 0.
